Package: stats37
Type: Package
Title: Helper Functions for the IAI CS1B Actuarial Statistics Practical Paper
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Manohar", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "example@gmail.com")
Description: Ready-to-use R functions for every topic that appears in the
    Institute and Faculty of Actuaries / IAI CS1B (Actuarial Statistics, Paper B)
    practical exam: distributions, simulation and the CLT, hypothesis tests and
    confidence intervals, chi-square tests, ANOVA, correlation, regression,
    generalised linear models, principal components, conjugate Bayesian
    analysis, empirical Bayes credibility theory, the bootstrap and maximum
    likelihood. Every function documents when to use it and what each
    parameter means, and prints hypotheses and a decision in exam wording.
    Built from seven past papers (Dec 2022 to Nov 2025).
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: stats, graphics, utils
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
